{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-04-17 08:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alaska Airlines expands service and presence at Santa Rosa/Sonoma County', 'text': 'SEATTLE, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES IS INCREASING ITS SERVICE AND COMMITMENT TO SANTA ROSA/SONOMA COUNTY WITH MORE NONSTOP FLIGHTS BETWEEN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA AND THE HEART OF WINE COUNTRY. STARTING JUNE 1, THE AIRLINE WILL OFFER DAILY NONSTOP SERVICE BETWEEN SANTA ROSA/SONOMA COUNTY AND BURBANK.'}{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2021-04-17 08:25:00-04:56', 'title': 'Amgen Successfully Completes Acquisition Of Five Prime Therapeutics', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF., APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED TENDER OFFER TO PURCHASE ALL OUTSTANDING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF FIVE PRIME THERAPEUTICS (NASDAQ:FPRX), A CLINICAL-STAGE BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY FOCUSED ON DEVELOPING IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY AND TARGETED CANCER THERAPIES, FOR $38.00 PER SHARE IN CASH.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-04-17 07:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'Van Oord and Ansys Accelerate the Design of Highly Sustainable Offshore Wind Turbines', 'text': "PITTSBURGH, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS SOLUTIONS ENABLE VAN OORD TO QUICKLY INCREASE DESIGN LOAD COMBINATIONS AND IMPROVE CALCULATION TIME FOR ADVANCED WIND TURBINE FOUNDATION DEVELOPMENT VAN OORD'S ENGINEERS USE ANSYS CLOUD AND ANSYS MECHANICAL TO OPTIMIZE NEW PRODUCT DESIGN, MINIMIZE PROJECT RISK, STREAMLINE SUPPLIER NEGOTIATIONS AND SLASH PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT TIMELINES VAN OORD IS WORKING WITH ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) TO SPEED ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY WHILE EXPEDITING NEW PRODUCT DESIGNS FOR THE OFFSHORE WIND TURBINE INDUSTRY. ANSYS IS AIDING VAN OORD ENGINEERS IN THEIR DEVELOPMENT OF CUTTING-EDGE WIND TURBINE FOUNDATIONS, HELPING THEM INCREASE PRODUCT QUALITY AND DELIVER NEW INNOVATIONS TO MARKET FASTER THAN EVER BEFORE."}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-04-17 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'BNY Mellon Reports First Quarter 2021 Earnings of $858 Million or $0.97 Per Common Share', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REVENUE DOWN 5% EPS DOWN 8% ROE\xa0 9% ROTCE\xa0 16% (A) CET1\xa0 12.6% TIER 1 LEVERAGE\xa0 5.8% THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) TODAY REPORTED: 1Q21 VS. 1Q21 4Q20 1Q20 4Q20 1Q20 NET INCOME APPLICABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS (IN MILLIONS) $ 858 $ 702 $ 944 22 % (9) % DILUTED EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE $ 0.97 $ 0.79 $ 1.05 23 % (8) % \xa0 FIRST QUARTER RESULTS CEO COMMENTARY TOTAL REVENUE OF $3.9 BILLION, DECREASED 5% •\xa0 FEE REVENUE INCREASED 1% \xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0•\xa0 FEE REVENUE INCREASED 6% EXCLUDING MONEY MARKET FEE WAIVERS (A) •\xa0 OTHER REVENUE INCLUDES A $39 MILLION IMPAIRMENT FOR A RENEWABLE ENERGY\xa0INVESTMENT •\xa0 NET INTEREST REVENUE DECREASED 20% "WE DELIVERED A STRONG QUARTER AND CONTINUE TO SEE MOMENTUM ACROSS OUR BUSINESSES, DESPITE THE ONGOING IMPACT OF LOW INTEREST RATES.'}{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2021-04-17 07:30:00-04:56', 'title': "New Data at AAN 2021 from Across Biogen's MS Portfolio Demonstrate Positive Impact of Treatment on People Living with Relapsing Multiple Sclerosis", 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., APRIL 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW DATA FROM ITS INDUSTRY-LEADING PORTFOLIO OF MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS (MS) THERAPIES TO BE PRESENTED AT THE AMERICAN ACADEMY OF NEUROLOGY (AAN) 2021 VIRTUAL ANNUAL MEETING, APRIL 17-22. THE PRESENTATIONS INCLUDE DATA ON QUALITY OF LIFE BENEFITS AND ANALYSES OF EXTENDED INTERVAL DOSING (EID) WITH TYSABRI® (NATALIZUMAB) AS WELL AS NEW REAL-WORLD EXPERIENCE DATA FROM VUMERITY® (DIROXIMEL FUMARATE). THE RESEARCH ADDS TO THE VAST CLINICAL KNOWLEDGE BIOGEN CONTINUES TO ADVANCE AS PART OF ITS COMMITMENT TO THE CARE OF PEOPLE LIVING WITH MS.'}{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2021-04-17 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Caterpillar Announces Board of Directors Changes', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL., APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) IS ANNOUNCING THE RETIREMENT OF TWO LONG-TIME MEMBERS OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, JUAN GALLARDO AND WILLIAM (BILL) OSBORN.'}{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2021-04-17 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cerner to Release First Quarter 2021 Earnings Results May 5', 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO., APRIL 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERNER CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CERN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL RELEASE ITS FIRST QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS RESULTS BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS WEDNESDAY, MAY 5TH. FOLLOWING THE RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL HOLD A CONFERENCE CALL AT 8:00 A.M. CT THAT CAN BE ACCESSED VIA DIAL-IN OR WEBCAST. ON THE CALL, CERNER WILL DISCUSS ITS RESULTS AND OUTLOOK AND ANSWER QUESTIONS FROM THE INVESTMENT COMMUNITY. THE CALL MAY ALSO INCLUDE DISCUSSION OF CERNER DEVELOPMENTS AND OTHER MATERIAL AND FORWARD-LOOKING INFORMATION ABOUT BUSINESS AND FINANCIAL MATTERS.'}{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2021-04-17 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Monarch E&S, a division of Specialty Program Group / SPG Insurance Solutions in CA, awarded Chubb's Commercial Cornerstone Designation", 'text': "LOS ANGELES, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHUBB HAS BESTOWED ITS COMMERCIAL CORNERSTONE DESIGNATION ON\xa0MONARCH E&S, A DIVISION OF SPECIALTY PROGRAM GROUP / SPG INSURANCE SOLUTIONS IN CA.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 OF THE APPROXIMATELY 3,600 INSURANCE AGENCIES AND BROKERAGES IN NORTH AMERICA THAT WORK WITH CHUBB'S COMMERCIAL LINES INSURANCE BUSINESSES,\xa0FEWER THAN 6 PERCENT HAVE EARNED THE CORNERSTONE DESIGNATION."}{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'Citigroup Announces Full Redemption of Series Q Preferred Stock and Series R Preferred Stock', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIGROUP INC. IS REDEEMING, IN WHOLE, ALL THE CURRENTLY OUTSTANDING $1.25 BILLION AGGREGATE LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE OF SERIES Q DEPOSITARY SHARES REPRESENTING INTERESTS IN ITS 5.950% FIXED RATE / FLOATING RATE NONCUMULATIVE PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES Q (THE “SERIES Q PREFERRED STOCK”). CITIGROUP IS ALSO REDEEMING, IN WHOLE, ALL THE CURRENTLY OUTSTANDING $1.035 BILLION AGGREGATE LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE OF SERIES R DEPOSITARY SHARES REPRESENTING INTERESTS IN ITS 6.125% FIXE'}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Conagra Brands Announces Quarterly Dividend Payment', 'text': "CHICAGO, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $0.275 PER SHARE OF CAG COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON JUNE 2, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 30, 2021. ABOUT CONAGRA BRANDS CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG), HEADQUARTERED IN CHICAGO, IS ONE OF NORTH AMERICA'S LEADING BRANDED FOOD COMPANIES."}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'Destaco Introduces PGM40, New Part Positioner', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DESTACO, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE A NEW ADDITION TO ITS PORTFOLIO OF HIGH-PERFORMANCE PART-POSITIONING SOLUTIONS.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:02:00-04:56', 'title': "Duke Energy responds to North Carolina Utilities Commission's decision on Duke Energy Progress' 2019 rate request", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IN RESPONSE TO TODAY'S ORDER BY THE NORTH CAROLINA UTILITIES COMMISSION (NCUC) ON THE\xa0RATE ADJUSTMENT REQUEST\xa0MADE BY DUKE ENERGY PROGRESS ON OCT. 30, 2019."}{'symbol': 'FLT', 'date': '2021-04-17 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cambridge Global Payments Extends Sponsorship of Exclusive Autosport Racing Team', 'text': 'TORONTO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMBRIDGE GLOBAL PAYMENTS (“CAMBRIDGE”), A FLEETCOR COMPANY (NYSE: FLT) AND A PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED CROSS-BORDER PAYMENTS AND CURRENCY RISK MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THEY HAVE EXTENDED THEIR SPONSORSHIP OF EXCLUSIVE AUTOSPORT (EA), A CANADIAN-OWNED PROFESSIONAL RACING TEAM FOR THE UPCOMING 2021 RACING SEASON. AS PART OF THIS SPONSORSHIP EXTENSION FOR THE 2021 RACING SEASON, CAMBRIDGE HAS BEEN NAMED THE TITLE SPONSOR FOR #91 CAMBRIDGE EXCLUSIVE AUTOS'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:54:00-04:56', 'title': 'Photo Release — Huntington Ingalls Industries Achieves Milestone in Refueling and Complex Overhaul of USS George Washington (CVN 73)', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., APRIL 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES' (NYSE:HII) NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION REACHED A MAJOR MILESTONE ON THE REFUELING AND COMPLEX OVERHAUL (RCOH) OF USS GEORGE WASHINGTON (CVN 73)."}{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-04-17 07:47:00-04:56', 'title': 'Invesco to Transition Front-to-Back Investment Servicing to State Street Alpha℠ Platform', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH INVESCO LTD. (NYSE: IVZ) WHICH WILL RESULT IN INVESCO ADOPTING STATE STREET ALPHA℠, THE FIRST FRONT-TO-BACK ASSET SERVICING PLATFORM FROM A SINGLE PROVIDER FOR INSTITUTIONAL AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT FIRMS. THE MIGRATION TO ALPHA IS INTENDED TO SIMPLIFY INVESCO'S INVESTMENT INFRASTRUCTURE TO IMPROVE SCALE, REDUCE RISK AND IMPROVE OPERATING EFFICIENCY. STATE STREET ALPHA IS A FULL"}{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2021-04-17 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The J.M. Smucker Co. Declares Dividend and Announces Annual Meeting Date', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO, APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A $0.90 PER SHARE DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON SHARES OF THE COMPANY.'}{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2021-04-17 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Kansas City Southern Reports First Quarter Results', 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN (KCS) (NYSE:KSU) REPORTED REVENUES OF $706.0 MILLION, A DECREASE OF 4% FROM FIRST QUARTER 2020. OVERALL, CARLOAD VOLUMES WERE DOWN 1% COMPARED TO PRIOR YEAR. FIRST QUARTER 2021 FIRST QU